      "writtenOn": "2025-12-30T00:49:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, you are correct.\nThe MAC address in wonder_mac80211_init is assigned to the wiphy (wireless physical device) and is mandatory for mac80211 registration. But, eth_random_addr() here is used by the vendor driver to provide a unique, random MAC address to the wondertap interface each time it is brought up.",
